{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>DEVELOPER NOTE</strong>: Hey, I'm DoctorLoops!\u00a0<i>Headspace</i> was a game I privately worked on as a fun hobby, but when my webcomic started getting big, I eventually had to abandon game development. Rather than delete <i>Headspace</i>, I wanted to publish the content that I was able to finish so everyone can play it! Even though the game is unfinished, I hope you enjoy what I was able to make!]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arrow Keys:<strong> Movement</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Z key: <strong>Confirm/Interact</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>X key: <strong>Cancel/Pause</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shift: <strong>Sprint</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspect everything! You never know when you might find something...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;After an electrical accident at your computer, you suddenly find yourself <strong>trapped inside your own mind!</strong> To make things worse, thanks to your mind-numbing job and over-reliance on the internet, your mind is <strong>creatively bankrupt </strong>- bleak nothingness as far as the eye can see, while malicious <strong>Dark Thoughts</strong> roam the depths of your subconscious. With the power of <strong>Inspiration</strong>, your lewd <strong>Fantasies, </strong>and long-lost <strong>Memories,</strong> there might just be a way to repair your broken mind and escape the confines of your <strong>Headspace</strong>!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993810/extras/357afff098bbdeec8d3b376e9449495a.avif?t=1771445869\" width=808 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles while\u00a0traversing the realm of your mind and battle against dangerous <strong>Dark Thoughts!</strong> Then come home and give your wife a smooch.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993810/extras/8aae754ef0b494f6d967beab4f0d2f01.avif?t=1771445869\" width=803 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is a pretty sexual place, but thankfully, so are all the denizens of your thoughts! Help them out and maybe they'll reward you (at least, the ones that aren't trying to end you!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993810/extras/37fd683d61fb1b11a13ec0bd22558545.avif?t=1771445869\" width=800 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[<strong>DEVELOPER NOTE (again)</strong>: Hey, I'm DoctorLoops!\u00a0<i>Headspace</i> was a game I privately worked on as a fun hobby, but when my webcomic started getting big, I eventually had to abandon game development. Rather than delete <i>Headspace</i>, I wanted to publish the content that I was able to finish so everyone can try it! Even though the game is unfinished, I hope you enjoy what I was able to make!]</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Fantasy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3993810/be1cd0de81f6aa850f9c610870872bc8f1847483.jpg"},{"name":"Tea Date","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3993810/97fb4965ea1ff2747393040be1d4b6cf16c418a1.jpg"},{"name":"Decepticrumbs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3993810/e9939ad1e2332d02bfa0e2478821f2ec38225da5.jpg"},{"name":"Rock Bottom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3993810/da5504631f77b917089c5928834aba4d26e84cd